# Large intermediates, never distributed. All eight directories that the
# release manifest excludes are listed here, with their size on the working
# tree, so that a `git add .` run in the repository root cannot stage them.
# The four marked (+) were missing from the first version of this file and
# together account for roughly 91 GB.
qiime2_final/          # 71 G
raw_data/              # 45 G
v2_2026.1/             # 39 G  (+)
raw_data_full/         # 39 G  (+)
raw_data_excluded/     # 11 G  (+)
qc_reports/            # 8.5 G
picrust2/              # 2.3 G (+)
merged/                # 1.1 G

